# A road across the map's wrapping edge, on raised ground, that starts on the castle's flag.
# Run it on the game view with seed 1234567812345678 and size 1 (a 32 x 32 map):
#   --game-view --seed 1234567812345678 --size 1 --play play/road-wrap.play
# The castle goes to 31,10, so its flag is at 0,11, across the edge between columns 31 and 0. A flag goes to 30,12.
click-tile 31 10
button Flag
click-tile 30 12
button Flag
wait 0.3
shot flags

scroll up 2 450 540
wait 0.3
button Road
click-tile 0 11
click-tile 31 11
wait 0.3
shot wrap-drawn
click-tile 31 12
click-tile 30 12
button Road
wait 0.3
shot wrap-built
wait 2
expect ticks > 10
dump built
